{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54407","headline":"富春二首（之二） · 吴融","name":"富春二首（之二）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两岸山花中有溪，山花红白偏高低。\n灵源忽若乘槎到，仙洞还同采药迷。\n二月辛夷犹未落，五更鸦舅最先啼。\n茶烟渔火遥看处，一片人家在水西。\n（见《唐音戊签》八十一〖《统签》卷七三四〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}